```css
#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] .xframe-mm-ruler-figure {
  width: 100%;
}

#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] [data-region="header"] p {
  font-size: 16px;
}

#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] [data-region="title"] h1 {
  font-size: 18px;
}

#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] [data-region="title"] p,
#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] figcaption,
#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] .xframe-image-replace-controls {
  display: none;
}

#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] [data-region="script"] {
  padding: 8px;
  background: #fff;
  border-top: 3px solid var(--stamp-accent);
  font-family: var(--stamp-serif);
}

#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] [data-region="script"] p {
  margin: 0 0 10px;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.42;
}

#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] [data-region$="-label"] p {
  padding: 3px;
  font-size: 11px;
}

#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] [data-region="footer"] {
  left: 0 !important;
  width: 100% !important;
  height: 26px !important;
  bottom: 0 !important;
}

#xframe .segment[data-layout="stamp-exhibit-print"] [data-region="footer"] p {
  font-size: 9px;
}
```
